      "description": "<p><em>*** EventMobi is an all-remote company and this is a fully remote position, open to all candidates with a focus in Pakistan, India, Brazil, Columbia, Argentina and Mexico.\u00a0</em></p>\n<p><br><em>You will need to be able to work in EST time zones. ***</em><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold\">WHY YOU SHOULD JOIN US?</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>At EventMobi, you won\u2019t just build UI components. \u00a0You\u2019ll help deliver meaningful product experiences used by thousands of organizations around the world.<br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Our front-end applications are large-scale React/TypeScript systems with real-world complexity: offline capabilities, cross-device support, and performance-sensitive rendering. You\u2019ll work on features that directly impact users, while developing a deeper understanding of how modern front-end systems are designed and evolve over time.<br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>This role is ideal for engineers who are strong in fundamentals, take pride in their craft, and want to grow into more advanced system design and ownership over time.<br>We believe great engineers take ownership of their work, collaborate openly, and continuously improve. You\u2019ll be supported by experienced teammates while having the autonomy to contribute meaningfully from day one.<br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>We also believe the next generation of engineers will be AI-native. You\u2019ll be encouraged to use AI-assisted tools to improve productivity, code quality, and learning speed.<br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold\">HEAR FROM OUR FRONT-END ENGINEER, MOEED:\u00a0</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold\"><em><br></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold\"><em>\u201cI\u2019ve been here a little over 2 years, working across the front end, mostly focused on onsite and registration flows. What I have enjoyed the most here is a mix of real ownership and strong support. \u00a0You\u2019re trusted to lead meaningful work, but there\u2019s always someone ready to jump in and debug or brainstorm with you.\u00a0</em></span><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold\"><em>There\u2019s also never a shortage of genuinely interesting technical challenges, which keep things fun and help you grow. The team is very collaborative and product\u2011minded, and being here has pushed me to think beyond \u2018just code\u2019 to how what I build actually impacts customers and the business.\u201d</em></span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold\">WHAT YOUR WORK WILL FOCUS ON:</span><br></p>\n<p>This role sits at the intersection of hands-on development, product thinking, and continuous growth.<br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold\">Build Modern Web Experiences</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Develop responsive, high-quality interfaces using React &amp; JavaScript/TypeScript</li>\n<li>Contribute to features within our Progressive Web App</li>\n<li>Help deliver reliable experiences across devices and varying network conditions<br></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold\">Contribute to Feature Development</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Implement features from defined requirements and collaborate on design decisions</li>\n<li>Work closely with product managers, designers, and senior engineers</li>\n<li>Balance user experience, performance, and technical constraints<br></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold\">Work Within Scalable Front-End Systems</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Contribute to a shared codebase with established patterns and practices</li>\n<li>Participate in discussions around architecture and system improvements</li>\n<li>Learn how to navigate and improve large, evolving applications<br></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold\">Collaborate and Improve as a Team</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Participate in code reviews and technical discussions</li>\n<li>Apply feedback to continuously improve code quality and approach</li>\n<li>Contribute to a culture of collaboration, clarity, and shared ownership<br></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold\">Work Smarter with AI</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Use AI-assisted tools (e.g. Claude, Codex) to accelerate development</li>\n<li>Improve productivity in debugging, testing, and implementation tasks</li>\n<li>Continuously refine how you integrate AI into your workflow<br></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold\">YOUR QUALIFICATIONS:</span></p>\n<p>You\u2019re a solid engineer with strong fundamentals and a desire to grow.<br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<ul>\n<li>3\u20135 years of experience building user-facing web applications</li>\n<li>2+ years of experience with JavaScript/TypeScript and React</li>\n<li>Strong understanding of modern HTML, CSS, and front-end fundamentals</li>\n<li>Experience working with APIs and integrating backend services</li>\n<li>Ability to debug issues and work within existing codebases</li>\n<li>Familiarity with testing (unit and end-to-end)</li>\n<li>Clear written communication skills (we\u2019re async-first)<br></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold\">NICE TO HAVE:</span><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Experience with state management or data-fetching libraries (e.g., React Query)</li>\n<li>Exposure to performance optimization or scalable front-end patterns</li>\n<li>Familiarity with CI/CD workflows or cloud environments</li>\n<li>Interest in mobile or cross-platform development<br></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold\">THIS ROLE IS A GREAT FIT FOR YOU IF..</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<ul>\n<li>You enjoy building real features that users rely on</li>\n<li>You\u2019re comfortable working with some ambiguity but appreciate guidance</li>\n<li>You want to grow your skills in architecture and system design over time</li>\n<li>You value feedback and continuous improvement</li>\n<li>You\u2019re excited about using modern tools, including AI, to work more effectively<br></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold\">THIS ROLE IS PROBABLY <em>NOT </em>FOR YOU IF..</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<ul>\n<li>You\u2019re primarily looking to define architecture and lead technical direction</li>\n<li>You prefer highly structured, narrowly scoped tasks with little ambiguity</li>\n<li>You\u2019re not interested in collaborating closely or receiving feedback</li>\n<li>You\u2019re uncomfortable working in a remote, async-first environment<br></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold\">OUR INTERVIEW PROCESS</span></p>\n<p>If your profile moves forward, here\u2019s what you can expect during the hiring process:<br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: bold\">\u00a0Introductory Conversation (45 minutes)</span><br>Meet with the VP of Product &amp; Engineering to discuss your background, experience, and career goals.</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: bold\">Technical Assessment (120 minutes)</span><br>Participate in a live, hands-on session with members of our technical team to demonstrate your problem-solving and coding skills.</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: bold\">Project Deep Dive (90 minutes)</span><br>Walk us through impactful projects you\u2019ve worked on, highlighting your contributions, decisions, and outcomes.</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: bold\">Offer Stage</span><br>Final discussions and next steps.<br><br></li>\n</ol>\n<p>We\u2019ll provide more details at each stage and ensure you have plenty of opportunities to ask questions along the way.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold\">WHAT WILL YOU GET FROM EVENTMOBI?\u00a0</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: bold\">Compensation: </span>Base salary ranges from $40k to $65k CAD per annual, depending on experience</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: bold\">Time-Off: </span>2-weeks PTO + 3-summer days + your birthday is a \u00a0holiday (seriously! log-off and hang out with the fam or go do something fun) + opportunities to meet your co-workers in person throughout the year</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: bold\">Tools:</span> Top of the line hardware and the best collaboration software for remote work so you can be as productive as possible while working from home</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: bold\">The Best Coworkers Ever: </span>If you ask anyone that has worked at EventMobi, they will tell you that their fellow Mobiers are the best part of their experience! Don't underestimate the positive impact of caring co-workers have on your everyday happiness.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold\">REMOTE WORKSPACE REQUIREMENTS:</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<ul>\n<li>You have a safe, comfortable, and ergonomic workspace and working environment - a private and quiet workspace is a vital requirement for doing your best work!</li>\n<li>You have a reliable internet connection capable of participating in video calls, with at least 30Mbps download speed.</li>\n<li>Ability to collaborate during EST working hours.<br></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold\">ABOUT EVENTMOBI \u00a0</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>We're focused on building the most comprehensive event management platform to help conference organizers create engaging event experiences. We believe live events bring people together and enable positive change. Over 30,000+ events in 70+ countries from major brands such as Shoppers Drug Mart to amazing non-profits such as American Psychiatric Nurses Association and Canadian Real Estate Association have trusted EventMobi\u2019s suite of software technology to manage their events and engage their attendees. \u00a0</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>If you are interested in seeing EventMobi in action, check out some of the videos below:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tWW9jB85S3w\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Experience Manager Platform</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hmJpVOe5dRE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The EventMobi Mobile Event App</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://go.eventmobi.com/en-watch-product-tour\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Product Tour</a></li>\n<li>Top brands and organizations from around the world have used EventMobi\u2019s event app technology to create incredible event experiences - <a href=\"https://www.eventmobi.com/customers/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">hear directly from our customers.</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><em>EventMobi is committed to creating a diverse environment and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment. Accommodations are available upon request for candidates taking part in all aspects of the selection process.</em></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>",
